      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No transcribed meetings yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aucune voix connue. Nomme un locuteur dans le transcript d'une réunion (avec la reconnaissance activée) pour qu'il soit reconnu la prochaine fois.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No known voices yet. Name a speaker in a meeting transcript (with recognition turned on) and they'll be recognized next time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Autorise l'accès complet": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow Full Access"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "C'est fait": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ce qui distingue deux voix sur la même note": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What tells two voices apart on the same note"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certains passages n'ont pas pu être transcrits (réseau).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some passages couldn't be transcribed (network)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ces instructions guident le modèle qui rédige le compte rendu (structure, ton, sections…). Tu peux les ajuster réunion par réunion. Le texte du transcript est envoyé à Groq pour la rédaction ; le modèle précis est plus lent et plus limité en débit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These instructions guide the model that writes the meeting report (structure, tone, sections…). You can adjust them meeting by meeting. The transcript text is sent to Groq to write the report; the accurate model is slower and more rate-limited."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clé API Groq": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Groq API key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clé API Groq manquante — configure-la dans les réglages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Groq API key missing — set it in Settings."
